<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels. (NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount NB-no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> August	    35 P/NS	August	  30/50 P</p>
<p> Sept	    120/150 P	Sept	  115/140 P</p>
<p> Apr		even/3 P	Apr	    3 D/even</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> August		NB/NS	August	    NB/NS</p>
<p> Sept		  2/6 P	Sept		3/5 P</p>
<p> Oct		 18/24 P	Oct	     17/22 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> August	   145/180 P	August	140/180 P</p>
<p> Sept	     140/180 P	Sept	  150/180 P</p>
<p> Oct		140/180 P	Oct	   150/180 P</p>
</text>
